title: "PhonoAgent: multi-cluster orchestration for high-throughput phonon and force-constant workflows"
message: "If you use PhonoAgent in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "wangchao"
    given-names: ""
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-15"
