keywords:
  - phonons
  - force constants
  - high-throughput
  - VASP
  - MACE
  - workflow
abstract: >-
  PhonoAgent orchestrates multi-step DFT (VASP) and machine-learning-potential (MACE)
  workflows for phonon and force-constant calculations across several HPC clusters.
  It provides criterion-driven step advancement, provenance tracking, reproducible
  session export, an approval gate for agent-driven actions, and a drop-in interface
  for new skills.
